@page
@model LearnHub.Pages.AboutModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "About LearnHub"; }
<section class="panel editor">
    <p class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL DIGITAL LEARNING</p>
    <h1>A place to build your foundations.</h1>
    <p>LearnHub helps learners study web development, databases and secure applications through short lessons and self-assessment quizzes.</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Explore the course catalogue.</li>
        <li>Create an account and enrol in a course.</li>
        <li>Read the lessons and mark your progress.</li>
        <li>Take a quiz and review your results.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2>Your learning data</h2>
    <p>Your account, enrolments, completed lessons and quiz scores are stored by this platform. You can keep private notes, join enrolled course discussions and review saved answers. Administrators manage course content, users and discussion moderation. Removing a course also removes the learning records attached to it.</p>
</section>
